<attribute name="purpose" nodeId="d1ff6005">&lt;p&gt;
    The purpose of this artifact is to:
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Provide guidance and create the basis for all decision-making with regard to the architectures.
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Enforce compliance with the defined target architecture.
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Enable the effective and consistent management and implementation of the architectures.
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</attribute>
